            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article deals with influence of coal rock dust on biochemical and immunologic serum parameters in experiment. Findings are that 3-week impact of coal rock dust (22 mg/m3) causes stress reaction and metabolism activation. Double increase of the duration and the concentration induces hypoxia component, immune deficiency elements and inflammation start.</AbstractText>
